{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stranded on the Moon. Out of fuel. Out of luck. And somehow... still laughing.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Together: Moon Escape</strong>, you and a partner must cooperate to escape a chaotic lunar mission gone very, very wrong. Explore a variety of handcrafted levels \u2014 from crumbling space stations to dusty caves and eerie lunar bases \u2014 all packed with puzzles, surprises, and <i>way too many Tumor-Inducing Lunar Slimes</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not your average serious space game. Expect absurd tools, ridiculous logic, and nonstop co-op chaos. Whether you're arguing over a puzzle or laughing at your partner falling into a crater (again), you\u2019ll need each other to get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/9b57041e7c22203705819c5bb0cbb840.poster.avif?t=1760721705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/9b57041e7c22203705819c5bb0cbb840.webm?t=1760721705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/9b57041e7c22203705819c5bb0cbb840.mp4?t=1760721705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/268cddfbb28319bfbebf0b0d4b234f1a.poster.avif?t=1760721705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/268cddfbb28319bfbebf0b0d4b234f1a.webm?t=1760721705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/268cddfbb28319bfbebf0b0d4b234f1a.mp4?t=1760721705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-player online or local co-op</strong> \u2013 Grab a friend and play split-screen or over the internet. No solo mode: this Moon demands teamwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic co-op puzzles</strong> \u2013 Communication is key! You\u2019ll each see different things, control different systems, or need to act in perfect sync.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lunar exploration</strong> \u2013 Escape across varied environments like the Moon\u2019s surface, dark caves, derelict ships, and secret facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ridiculous tools</strong> \u2013 Use special weapons and gadgets like the <i>Slime Blaster</i> or the <i>Slime Vision Goggles</i> to solve puzzles and prank your partner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized for smooth performance</strong> \u2013 Built with Unreal Engine and fully optimized for low-end systems and Steam Deck (runs at 60fps).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short, sweet, and full of laughter</strong> \u2013 Designed to be completed in a few sessions, but with plenty of replay value and jokes to keep you coming back.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/341f726a9b2ec60e9dc73b0da5530ab5.poster.avif?t=1760721705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/341f726a9b2ec60e9dc73b0da5530ab5.webm?t=1760721705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/341f726a9b2ec60e9dc73b0da5530ab5.mp4?t=1760721705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/72af1cb333511061e1081c8151f15789.poster.avif?t=1760721705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/72af1cb333511061e1081c8151f15789.webm?t=1760721705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/extras/72af1cb333511061e1081c8151f15789.mp4?t=1760721705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744430?t=1760721705","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/5c26f74a1f21eef382e1f3e4f0ef758685ed6f4b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760721705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/9cbf83fcb0fce6c253cff98daaa580b7ba3268cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760721705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744430/9cbf83fcb0fce6c253cff98daaa580b7ba3268cc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760721705","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Re